  67: [
    Verse(number: 1, arabic: 'تَبَٰرَكَ ٱلَّذِي بِيَدِهِ ٱلۡمُلۡكُ وَهُوَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيۡءٖ قَدِيرٌ', transliteration: 'Tabaraka allathee biyadihi almulku wahuwa AAala kulli shayin qadeerun', translation: 'Blessed is He in whose hand is dominion, and He is over all things competent'),
    Verse(number: 2, arabic: 'ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَ ٱلۡمَوۡتَ وَٱلۡحَيَوٰةَ لِيَبۡلُوَكُمۡ أَيُّكُمۡ أَحۡسَنُ عَمَلٗاۚ وَهُوَ ٱلۡعَزِيزُ ٱلۡغَفُورُ', transliteration: 'Allathee khalaqa almawta waalhayata liyabluwakum ayyukum ahsanu AAamalan wahuwa alAAazeezu alghafooru', translation: '[He] who created death and life to test you [as to] which of you is best in deed - and He is the Exalted in Might, the Forgiving'),
    Verse(number: 3, arabic: 'ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَ سَبۡعَ سَمَٰوَٰتٖ طِبَاقٗاۖ مَّا تَرَىٰ فِي خَلۡقِ ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنِ مِن تَفَٰوُتٖۖ فَٱرۡجِعِ ٱلۡبَصَرَ هَلۡ تَرَىٰ مِن فُطُورٖ', transliteration: 'Allathee khalaqa sabAAa samawatin tibaqan ma tara fee khalqi alrrahmani min tafawutin fairjiAAi albasara hal tara min futoorin', translation: '[And] who created seven heavens in layers. You do not see in the creation of the Most Merciful any inconsistency. So return [your] vision [to the sky]; do you see any breaks'),
    Verse(number: 4, arabic: 'ثُمَّ ٱرۡجِعِ ٱلۡبَصَرَ كَرَّتَيۡنِ يَنقَلِبۡ إِلَيۡكَ ٱلۡبَصَرُ خَاسِئٗا وَهُوَ حَسِيرٞ', transliteration: 'Thumma irjiAAi albasara karratayni yanqalib ilayka albasaru khasian wahuwa haseerun', translation: 'Then return [your] vision twice again. [Your] vision will return to you humbled while it is fatigued'),
    Verse(number: 5, arabic: 'وَلَقَدۡ زَيَّنَّا ٱلسَّمَآءَ ٱلدُّنۡيَا بِمَصَٰبِيحَ وَجَعَلۡنَٰهَا رُجُومٗا لِّلشَّيَٰطِينِۖ وَأَعۡتَدۡنَا لَهُمۡ عَذَابَ ٱلسَّعِيرِ', transliteration: 'Walaqad zayyanna alssamaa alddunya bimasabeeha wajaAAalnaha rujooman lilshshayateeni waaAAtadna lahum AAathaba alssaAAeeri', translation: 'And We have certainly beautified the nearest heaven with stars and have made [from] them what is thrown at the devils and have prepared for them the punishment of the Blaze'),
    Verse(number: 6, arabic: 'وَلِلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ بِرَبِّهِمۡ عَذَابُ جَهَنَّمَۖ وَبِئۡسَ ٱلۡمَصِيرُ', transliteration: 'Walillatheena kafaroo birabbihim AAathabu jahannama wabisa almaseeru', translation: 'And for those who disbelieved in their Lord is the punishment of Hell, and wretched is the destination'),
    Verse(number: 7, arabic: 'إِذَآ أُلۡقُواْ فِيهَا سَمِعُواْ لَهَا شَهِيقٗا وَهِيَ تَفُورُ', transliteration: 'Itha olqoo feeha samiAAoo laha shaheeqan wahiya tafooru', translation: 'When they are thrown into it, they hear from it a [dreadful] inhaling while it boils up'),
    Verse(number: 8, arabic: 'تَكَادُ تَمَيَّزُ مِنَ ٱلۡغَيۡظِۖ كُلَّمَآ أُلۡقِيَ فِيهَا فَوۡجٞ سَأَلَهُمۡ خَزَنَتُهَآ أَلَمۡ يَأۡتِكُمۡ نَذِيرٞ', transliteration: 'Takadu tamayyazu mina alghaythi kullama olqiya feeha fawjun saalahum khazanatuha alam yatikum natheerun', translation: 'It almost bursts with rage. Every time a company is thrown into it, its keepers ask them, "Did there not come to you a warner'),
    Verse(number: 9, arabic: 'قَالُواْ بَلَىٰ قَدۡ جَآءَنَا نَذِيرٞ فَكَذَّبۡنَا وَقُلۡنَا مَا نَزَّلَ ٱللَّهُ مِن شَيۡءٍ إِنۡ أَنتُمۡ إِلَّا فِي ضَلَٰلٖ كَبِيرٖ', transliteration: 'Qaloo bala qad jaana natheerun fakaththabna waqulna ma nazzala Allahu min shayin in antum illa fee dalalin kabeerin', translation: 'They will say," Yes, a warner had come to us, but we denied and said, \'Allah has not sent down anything. You are not but in great error'),
    Verse(number: 10, arabic: 'وَقَالُواْ لَوۡ كُنَّا نَسۡمَعُ أَوۡ نَعۡقِلُ مَا كُنَّا فِيٓ أَصۡحَٰبِ ٱلسَّعِيرِ', transliteration: 'Waqaloo law kunna nasmaAAu aw naAAqilu ma kunna fee ashabi alssaAAeeri', translation: 'And they will say, "If only we had been listening or reasoning, we would not be among the companions of the Blaze'),
    Verse(number: 11, arabic: 'فَٱعۡتَرَفُواْ بِذَنۢبِهِمۡ فَسُحۡقٗا لِّأَصۡحَٰبِ ٱلسَّعِيرِ', transliteration: 'FaiAAtarafoo bithanbihim fasuhqan liashabi alssaAAeeri', translation: 'And they will admit their sin, so [it is] alienation for the companions of the Blaze'),
    Verse(number: 12, arabic: 'إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَخۡشَوۡنَ رَبَّهُم بِٱلۡغَيۡبِ لَهُم مَّغۡفِرَةٞ وَأَجۡرٞ كَبِيرٞ', transliteration: 'Inna allatheena yakhshawna rabbahum bialghaybi lahum maghfiratun waajrun kabeerun', translation: 'Indeed, those who fear their Lord unseen will have forgiveness and great reward'),
    Verse(number: 13, arabic: 'وَأَسِرُّواْ قَوۡلَكُمۡ أَوِ ٱجۡهَرُواْ بِهِۦٓۖ إِنَّهُۥ عَلِيمُۢ بِذَاتِ ٱلصُّدُورِ', transliteration: 'Waasirroo qawlakum awi ijharoo bihi innahu AAaleemun bithati alssudoori', translation: 'And conceal your speech or publicize it; indeed, He is Knowing of that within the breasts'),
    Verse(number: 14, arabic: 'أَلَا يَعۡلَمُ مَنۡ خَلَقَ وَهُوَ ٱللَّطِيفُ ٱلۡخَبِيرُ', transliteration: 'Ala yaAAlamu man khalaqa wahuwa allateefu alkhabeeru', translation: 'Does He who created not know, while He is the Subtle, the Acquainted'),
    Verse(number: 15, arabic: 'هُوَ ٱلَّذِي جَعَلَ لَكُمُ ٱلۡأَرۡضَ ذَلُولٗا فَٱمۡشُواْ فِي مَنَاكِبِهَا وَكُلُواْ مِن رِّزۡقِهِۦۖ وَإِلَيۡهِ ٱلنُّشُورُ', transliteration: 'Huwa allathee jaAAala lakumu alarda thaloolan faimshoo fee manakibiha wakuloo min rizqihi wailayhi alnnushooru', translation: 'It is He who made the earth tame for you - so walk among its slopes and eat of His provision - and to Him is the resurrection'),
    Verse(number: 16, arabic: 'ءَأَمِنتُم مَّن فِي ٱلسَّمَآءِ أَن يَخۡسِفَ بِكُمُ ٱلۡأَرۡضَ فَإِذَا هِيَ تَمُورُ', transliteration: 'Aamintum man fee alssamai an yakhsifa bikumu alarda faitha hiya tamooru', translation: 'Do you feel secure that He who [holds authority] in the heaven would not cause the earth to swallow you and suddenly it would sway'),
    Verse(number: 17, arabic: 'أَمۡ أَمِنتُم مَّن فِي ٱلسَّمَآءِ أَن يُرۡسِلَ عَلَيۡكُمۡ حَاصِبٗاۖ فَسَتَعۡلَمُونَ كَيۡفَ نَذِيرِ', transliteration: 'Am amintum man fee alssamai an yursila AAalaykum hasiban fasataAAlamoona kayfa natheeri', translation: 'Or do you feel secure that He who [holds authority] in the heaven would not send against you a storm of stones? Then you would know how [severe] was My warning'),
    Verse(number: 18, arabic: 'وَلَقَدۡ كَذَّبَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبۡلِهِمۡ فَكَيۡفَ كَانَ نَكِيرِ', transliteration: 'Walaqad kaththaba allatheena min qablihim fakayfa kana nakeeri', translation: 'And already had those before them denied, and how [terrible] was My reproach'),
    Verse(number: 19, arabic: 'أَوَلَمۡ يَرَوۡاْ إِلَى ٱلطَّيۡرِ فَوۡقَهُمۡ صَـٰٓفَّـٰتٖ وَيَقۡبِضۡنَۚ مَا يُمۡسِكُهُنَّ إِلَّا ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنُۚ إِنَّهُۥ بِكُلِّ شَيۡءِۭ بَصِيرٌ', transliteration: 'Awalam yaraw ila alttayri fawqahum saffatin wayaqbidna ma yumsikuhunna illa alrrahmanu innahu bikulli shayin baseerun', translation: 'Do they not see the birds above them with wings outspread and [sometimes] folded in? None holds them [aloft] except the Most Merciful. Indeed He is, of all things, Seeing'),
    Verse(number: 20, arabic: 'أَمَّنۡ هَٰذَا ٱلَّذِي هُوَ جُندٞ لَّكُمۡ يَنصُرُكُم مِّن دُونِ ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنِۚ إِنِ ٱلۡكَٰفِرُونَ إِلَّا فِي غُرُورٍ', transliteration: 'Amman hatha allathee huwa jundun lakum yansurukum min dooni alrrahmani ini alkafiroona illa fee ghuroorin', translation: 'Or who is it that could be an army for you to aid you other than the Most Merciful? The disbelievers are not but in delusion'),
    Verse(number: 21, arabic: 'أَمَّنۡ هَٰذَا ٱلَّذِي يَرۡزُقُكُمۡ إِنۡ أَمۡسَكَ رِزۡقَهُۥۚ بَل لَّجُّواْ فِي عُتُوّٖ وَنُفُورٍ', transliteration: 'Amman hatha allathee yarzuqukum in amsaka rizqahu bal lajjoo fee AAutuwwin wanufoorin', translation: 'Or who is it that could provide for you if He withheld His provision? But they have persisted in insolence and aversion'),
    Verse(number: 22, arabic: 'أَفَمَن يَمۡشِي مُكِبًّا عَلَىٰ وَجۡهِهِۦٓ أَهۡدَىٰٓ أَمَّن يَمۡشِي سَوِيًّا عَلَىٰ صِرَٰطٖ مُّسۡتَقِيمٖ', transliteration: 'Afaman yamshee mukibban AAala wajhihi ahda amman yamshee sawiyyan AAala siratin mustaqeemin', translation: 'Then is one who walks fallen on his face better guided or one who walks erect on a straight path'),
    Verse(number: 23, arabic: 'قُلۡ هُوَ ٱلَّذِيٓ أَنشَأَكُمۡ وَجَعَلَ لَكُمُ ٱلسَّمۡعَ وَٱلۡأَبۡصَٰرَ وَٱلۡأَفۡـِٔدَةَۚ قَلِيلٗا مَّا تَشۡكُرُونَ', transliteration: 'Qul huwa allathee anshaakum wajaAAala lakumu alssamAAa waalabsara waalafidata qaleelan ma tashkuroona', translation: 'Say, "It is He who has produced you and made for you hearing and vision and hearts; little are you grateful'),
    Verse(number: 24, arabic: 'قُلۡ هُوَ ٱلَّذِي ذَرَأَكُمۡ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَإِلَيۡهِ تُحۡشَرُونَ', transliteration: 'Qul huwa allathee tharaakum fee alardi wailayhi tuhsharoona', translation: 'Say, "It is He who has multiplied you throughout the earth, and to Him you will be gathered'),
    Verse(number: 25, arabic: 'وَيَقُولُونَ مَتَىٰ هَٰذَا ٱلۡوَعۡدُ إِن كُنتُمۡ صَٰدِقِينَ', transliteration: 'Wayaqooloona mata hatha alwaAAdu in kuntum sadiqeena', translation: 'And they say, "When is this promise, if you should be truthful'),
    Verse(number: 26, arabic: 'قُلۡ إِنَّمَا ٱلۡعِلۡمُ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ وَإِنَّمَآ أَنَا۠ نَذِيرٞ مُّبِينٞ', transliteration: 'Qul innama alAAilmu AAinda Allahi wainnama ana natheerun mubeenun', translation: 'Say, "The knowledge is only with Allah, and I am only a clear warner'),
    Verse(number: 27, arabic: 'فَلَمَّا رَأَوۡهُ زُلۡفَةٗ سِيٓـَٔتۡ وُجُوهُ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ وَقِيلَ هَٰذَا ٱلَّذِي كُنتُم بِهِۦ تَدَّعُونَ', transliteration: 'Falamma raawhu zulfatan seeat wujoohu allatheena kafaroo waqeela hatha allathee kuntum bihi taddaAAoona', translation: 'But when they see it approaching, the faces of those who disbelieve will be distressed, and it will be said, "This is that for which you used to call'),
    Verse(number: 28, arabic: 'قُلۡ أَرَءَيۡتُمۡ إِنۡ أَهۡلَكَنِيَ ٱللَّهُ وَمَن مَّعِيَ أَوۡ رَحِمَنَا فَمَن يُجِيرُ ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ مِنۡ عَذَابٍ أَلِيمٖ', transliteration: 'Qul araaytum in ahlakaniya Allahu waman maAAiya aw rahimana faman yujeeru alkafireena min AAathabin aleemin', translation: 'Say, [O Muhammad], "Have you considered: whether Allah should cause my death and those with me or have mercy upon us, who can protect the disbelievers from a painful punishment'),
    Verse(number: 29, arabic: 'قُلۡ هُوَ ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنُ ءَامَنَّا بِهِۦ وَعَلَيۡهِ تَوَكَّلۡنَاۖ فَسَتَعۡلَمُونَ مَنۡ هُوَ فِي ضَلَٰلٖ مُّبِينٖ', transliteration: 'Qul huwa alrrahmanu amanna bihi waAAalayhi tawakkalna fasataAAlamoona man huwa fee dalalin mubeenin', translation: 'Say, "He is the Most Merciful; we have believed in Him, and upon Him we have relied. And you will [come to] know who it is that is in clear error'),
    Verse(number: 30, arabic: 'قُلۡ أَرَءَيۡتُمۡ إِنۡ أَصۡبَحَ مَآؤُكُمۡ غَوۡرٗا فَمَن يَأۡتِيكُم بِمَآءٖ مَّعِينِۭ', transliteration: 'Qul araaytum in asbaha maokum ghawran faman yateekum bimain maAAeenin', translation: 'Say, "Have you considered: if your water was to become sunken [into the earth], then who could bring you flowing water'),
  ],
  112: [
    Verse(number: 1, arabic: 'قُلۡ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ', transliteration: 'Qul huwa Allahu ahadun', translation: 'Say, "He is Allah, [who is] One'),
    Verse(number: 2, arabic: 'ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ', transliteration: 'Allahu alssamadu', translation: 'Allah, the Eternal Refuge'),
    Verse(number: 3, arabic: 'لَمۡ يَلِدۡ وَلَمۡ يُولَدۡ', transliteration: 'Lam yalid walam yooladu', translation: 'He neither begets nor is born'),
    Verse(number: 4, arabic: 'وَلَمۡ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدُۢ', transliteration: 'Walam yakun lahu kufuwan ahadun', translation: 'Nor is there to Him any equivalent'),
